type: software
title: "Web-to-Web BI Board"
abstract: "Open-source BI dashboard for subscription web funnels (web-to-web): cohort ROAS and payback from D0 to D360, sBG LTV and ROAS predictions, real-time ad spend monitoring and a funnel map. Static site, no backend, runs on a documented JSON data contract."
